<title>UK: Citibank prices and ups 2-tranche bond to $750 mln.</title>
<headline>Citibank prices and ups 2-tranche bond to $750 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following asset backed bond was priced and increased by lead manager Citibank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CITIBANK CCMT 97-2</p>
<p>TRANCHE A:</p>
<p> AMT  **$750 MLN	COUPON     6.55	LEG MAT     16.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.805    EXP MAT     15.FEB.02</p>
<p>			    REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 6.595 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	**INCREASED FROM $665 MLN</p>
<p>TRANCHE B: LEAD MANAGER MERRILL LYNCH.</p>
<p> AMT  **$48 MLN	 COUPON     6.70	MOODY/S&amp;P   A2/A</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.804596 YIELD	 6.745 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES	**INCREASED FROM $40 MLN</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> SPREAD OVER FIVE-YEAR W/I U.S. TREASURIES.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
